=== layout: one-panel

# Check the Tree Paths

@body

The tree uses cluster averages. Some distances along the tree differ from the original matrix.

These are example distances, not measurements or years.

Every root-to-tip path equals 7 distance units.

Equal path lengths follow the constant-rate model used to build the tree.

